<p>2.21. In accordance with KYC/AML policy, after the verification of player documents, Sportsbook reserves the right to impose various restrictions on the player&#39;s playing activity, including the possible subsequent blocking with the withdrawal of all funds if the player&#39;s personal information is found in the following lists:</p>
